      "content": "hey, i'm starting this new podcast called \"The Real View\" and it's gonna be all about just talking straight to regular people about stuff that the mainstream media won't touch. i want the vibe to be very \"common sense\" and for the listeners to feel like i'm on their side against all the bureaucrats and elites in DC. \n\ncan u write me a short intro script for the first episode? maybe something that sets the tone about how the world has changed and why people feel like they've been left behind by the people in charge?",
